    "pve": {
      "en": "Ward Spell. Place a ward of Teinai's Heat at your location for 10...14...15 seconds. Foes within the ward suffer 2...4...5 health [sic] degeneration. Weakened foes attack 33% slower. This skill is disabled for 20 seconds.",
